nd is proficient with a  variety of weapons he has a suit made of  extremely durable metal and he uses his  money to buy a lot of vehicles and  gadgets but none of that is why we're  talking about him because that's not  really what makes him omega level and  none of that's omega level stuff  beyond omega level the chevrolet  corvette so let's get into the story  that basically sees moon knight become  one of the most powerful characters in  comics now one of the things i want to  specify is that we do have this story in  its entirety although this will give you  kind of the quick and dirty version of  the story itself so make sure you guys  check out this card and that will take  you to the story involving jason aaron's  avengers run so this story opens we  basically end up seeing moon night in  kunlun which is the home of iron fists  and then immediately he tells danny rand  that he's there seeking the iron fist  and the two of them basically battle  which sees danny rand who's one of the  best fighters in the marvel universe not  only lose to moon knight but have the  power of the iron fist stolen by moon  knight's ankh amulet now moon knight  then leaves [ __ ] loon and travels to the  sanctum satorum the home of doctor  strange moon knight ends up attacking  doctor strange with the power of the  iron fist and then uses another amulet  to steal the power of the eye of  agamotto which is one of the most  powerful magical artifacts in all of  marvel comics and probably deserves its  own omega level video but moon knight  says that part of the reason he's able  to do this is because there is a super  moon amping up his power and already  moon knight has the power of the iron  fist in the eye of agamotto which  already makes him extremely powerful but  he doesn't stop there he then makes his  way to los angeles to the home of ghost  rider robbie reyes and steals his car  the hell charger he then travels to  wakanda with an army of the dead and  confronts black panther moon knight then  tries to steal the power of the black  panther but is unable to do so because  the power lies in the black panther's  blood moon knight is then confronted by  thor who vows to stop moon knight's  assault on the avengers but moon knight  is able to take mjolnir from him  effortlessly because the hammer is made  of rock that came from the moon and moon  knight is a servant of khanshu the god  of the moon and the plot demanded it so  moon knight uses the hammer to  absolutely thrash thor and then summons  moons from different galaxies and traps  thor between them we then learn that  moon knight is doing all this at the  behest of konchu who says that it's  necessary to save the world the one he's  saving the world from is actually  mephisto who's been imprisoned in a las  vegas hotel at the hands of doctor  strange now with his newfound powers  moon knight is able to destroy mephisto  without any resistance whatsoever as he  uses mjolnir to literally rip a hole in  mephisto's chest still this is not  enough for konju who takes the hammer  and conquers the world in two weeks time  enslaving the black panther for defying  him now later alternate versions of  mephisto from other universes attack  honshu in an attempt to punish him for  the crime of killing the main marvel  universe version of mephisto but in  order to defeat this guy for good konshu  decides that he will need additional  power from the phoenix force the star  brand which is a ridiculously powerful  source of energy and is really all you  need because your power matches whatever  force you're facing off against if you  have the power of the star brand and of  course the power of black panther who by  now has basically escaped konshu's  prison so moon knight tries to steal the  star brand power from a little girl but  carol danvers is able to save this  little kid at least for the moment  anyway shortly after moon knight goes to  the moon where he encounters nick fury  who took the place of uwa to the watcher  following the events of original scent  but nick fury informs moon knight that  he's basically been praying to the wrong  god but we don't find out what that  means essentially for a few more panels  in the meantime moon knight returns to  earth and battles a black panther again  while konchu now in possession of both  ghost riders hellfire and thor's hammer  seeks out the star brand now as he  closes in on the star brand he's  confronted by moon knight and we find  out that he's now praying to a different  god the god of the phoenix who has now  chosen moon knight for its host as you  probably know the phoenix force is one  of the most powerful forces in the  marvel universe and its power borders on  omnipotence and so imbued with the  phoenix's power moon knight is able to  weaken konshu who then loses the powers  that he's collected to the black panther  and ghost rider and so black panther  gives some of those powers to the other  avengers turning she-hulk into the iron  fist and blade into the sorcerer's  supreme which was really really cool but  after konchu was defeated moon knight  looks at the earth from space and then  contemplates what he's capable of doing  and for a moment considers purging the  earth of all of humankind in order to  save it but horrified that he's  considered committing genocide moon  knight realizes that he has to get rid  of the phoenix force and allows thor  who's escaped from the moon prison that  he trapped him in to pummel him with his  hammer which he recently regained now as  the story closes moon knight is left in  a crater on earth as the phoenix force  flies away and so that's how moon knight  a character that is definitively street  level  99.9 of the time became beyond omega  level four brief moment he was able to  defeat doctor strange and thor  effortlessly summon moons from other  galaxies and wielded the phoenix force  which is the sum total of all life that  has ever currently does or will ever  exist now in that moment moon knight  could have destroyed the world with a  simple thought and was actually a threat  to the entirety of the universe so all  of this makes this guy definitely a  beyond omega level threat but let me  know what you guys think down in the  comments section thank you all for  watching and i will catch you all later  peace
 

